#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers normal and roughness data to be output "
"during our depth pre-pass, only applicable for the Forward+ renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the roughness buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var roughness_buffer = "
"render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"forward_clustered\", "
"\"normal_roughness\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The raw normal and roughness buffer is stored in an optimized format, "
"different than the one available in Spatial shaders. When sampling the "
"buffer, a conversion function must be applied. Use this function, copied "
"from [url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"da5f39889f155658cef7f7ec3cc1abb94e17d815/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/"
"shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl#L334-L341]here[/"
"url]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec4 normal_roughness_compatibility(vec4 p_normal_roughness) {\n"
"\tfloat roughness = p_normal_roughness.w;\n"
"\tif (roughness > 0.5) {\n"
"\t\troughness = 1.0 - roughness;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\troughness /= (127.0 / 255.0);\n"
"\treturn vec4(normalize(p_normal_roughness.xyz * 2.0 - 1.0) * 0.5 + 0.5, "
"roughness);\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Si [code]true[/code] cela déclenche le calcul des données de normales et de "
"rugosité pendant notre pré-passe de profondeur, seulement applicable pour la "
"méthode de rendu Forward+.\n"
"[b]Note :[/b] Dans [method _render_callback], pour accéder au buffer de "
"rugosité, utilisez :\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var buffers_scene_rendue = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var buffer_rugosite = "
"buffers_scene_rendue.get_texture(\"forward_clustered\", "
"\"normal_roughness\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Le buffer de normales et de rugosité brut est stocké dans un format "
"optimisé, différent de celui disponible dans les shaders spatiaux. Lors de "
"l'échantillonnage du buffer, une fonction de conversion doit être appliquée. "
"Utilisez cette fonction, copiée d'[url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"blob/da5f39889f155658cef7f3cc1abb94e17d815/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/"
"shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered_inc.gls#341]ici[/url].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec4 compatibilite_rugosite_normale(vec4 p_normale_rugosite) {\n"
"\tfloat rugosite = p_normale_rugosite.w;\n"
"\tif (rugosite > 0.5) {\n"
"\t\trugosite = 1.0 - rugosite ;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\trugosite /= (127.0 / 255.0);\n"
"\treturn vec4(normalize(p_normale_rugosite.xyz * 2.0 - 1.0) * 0.5 + 0.5, "
"rugosite);\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers specular data being rendered to a "
"separate buffer and combined after effects have been applied, only "
"applicable for the Forward+ renderer."
msgstr ""
