"Otherwise, vertical synchronization is enabled to avoid tearing. Framerate "
"is limited by the monitor refresh rate (regardless of [member "
"Engine.max_fps]). Behaves like [constant VSYNC_ENABLED] when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
