#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Expands all foldable sections."
msgstr "Active ou désactive les collisions."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid ""
"Expands only the foldable sections that contain a revertable (i.e. non-"
