"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [HTTPRequest] nodes will automatically handle decompression of "
"response bodies. An [code]Accept-Encoding[/code] header will be "
"automatically added to each of your requests, unless one is already "
"specified. Any response with a [code]Content-Encoding: gzip[/code] header "
