"Format de texture OpenGL [code]RG[/code] avec deux composantes, chacune sur "
"8 bits."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]RGB[/code] with three components, each with a "
"bitdepth of 8.\n"
