"point aléatoire sur [member emission_point_texture]. La couleur des "
"particules sera modulée par [member emission_color_texture]."

#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted at a position determined by sampling a random "
"point on the [member emission_point_texture]. Particle velocity and rotation "
"will be set based on [member emission_normal_texture]. Particle color will "
"be modulated by [member emission_color_texture]."
msgstr ""
"Les particules seront émises à une position déterminée en échantillonnant un "
"point aléatoire sur [member emission_point_texture]. La vitesse et la "
