#: doc/classes/RenderingDevice.xml
msgid ""
"Asynchronous version of [method buffer_get_data]. RenderingDevice will call "
"[param callback] in a certain amount of frames with the data the buffer had "
"at the time of the request.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] At the moment, the delay corresponds to the amount of frames "
"specified by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/vsync/"
"frame_queue_size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Downloading large buffers can have a prohibitive cost for real-"
"time even when using the asynchronous method due to hardware bandwidth "
"limitations. When dealing with large resources, you can adjust settings such "
"as [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/staging_buffer/"
"block_size_kb] to improve the transfer speed at the cost of extra memory.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _buffer_get_data_callback(array):\n"
"\tvalue = array.decode_u32(0)\n"
"\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"rd.buffer_get_data_async(buffer, _buffer_get_data_callback)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
