"thread, which is slow. Do not use this method during gameplay to avoid "
"stuttering. If you need to read values in a script after setting them, "
"consider creating an autoload where you store the values you need to query "
"at the same time you're setting them as global parameters."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the type associated to the global shader uniform specified by [param "
"name].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method global_shader_parameter_get] has a large performance "
"penalty as the rendering thread needs to synchronize with the calling "
