msgstr "Renvoie le script directement hérité par ce script."

#: doc/classes/Script.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the class name associated with the script, if there is one. Returns "
"an empty string otherwise.\n"
"To give the script a global name, you can use the [code]class_name[/code] "
"keyword in GDScript and the [code][GlobalClass][/code] attribute in C#.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"class_name MyNode\n"
"extends Node\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[GlobalClass]\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Renvoie le nom de classe associé au script, s'il y en a un. Renvoie une "
"chaîne vide sinon.\n"
"Pour donner au script un nom global, vous pouvez utiliser le mot-clé "
"[code]class_name[/code] en GDScript et l'attribut [code][GlobalClass][/code] "
"en C#.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"class_name MonNoeud\n"
"extends Node\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[GlobalClass]\n"
"public partial class MonNoeud : Node\n"
"{\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

